CLCTqg&oe=6B0076D9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape (2560x1440).png", "id": "492689858427362", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974648_492689861760695_1651259702864724545_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PVvKoZ4K1R0Q7kNvwHz_cg2&_nc_oc=AdrNld2oinsj_SEYA4vDT2BCSJtk4ktsOtjTUAtj2lJFUCXNEdmDcTsqJ5AN7o1pcQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0QPjJ2AEiUjQDiQlfCHP-piRFGpEYKaX7suFpK4y7Hg&oe=6B006B32"}, "display_name": "Synth Riders Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Synth Riders Demo will no longer be supported on Meta Quest devices and new users will no longer be able to search & install this app. If you already \"own\" this entitlement, you will continue to have access.\n\n---------\n\nA FREESTYLE-DANCE RHYTHM ALTERNATIVE\n\nCUSTOM SONGS officially supported - never breaks with an update\nGOOD FITNESS - activates whole body without repetitive movements\nGREAT MUSIC \u2013 74 free and 67 DLC songs from Gorillaz, Muse & more\n\nIn the demo, you can play 7 songs on all difficulty levels and experiment with all the modifiers - unlimited!\n\nThe full version of Synth Riders is available on the Meta Quest Store featuring:\n\n\u2022 135 Songs - 74 free and 67 DLC, including Gorillaz, Muse, Caravan Palace, The Offspring and more!\n\u2022 Official Custom Song Support\n\u2022 Cross-Platform Multiplayer\n\u2022 360\u00b0 Spin Mode in Every Song\n\u2022 Party mode - local multiplayer\n\nWe hope you will enjoy the demo and join the Synth Riders community soon!", "short_description": "Synth Riders Demo will no longer be supported on Meta Quest devices and new users will no longer be able to search & install this app. If you already \"own\" this entitlement, you will continue to have access.\n\n---------\n\nWelcome to the demo of Synth Riders - a freestyle dancing VR rhythm alternative. The demo comes with 5 songs on all difficulty